* JOSS as a desk calculator: each line is done as soon as it is typed.
Type 2+2.
     2+2 =       4
Type 365·24·60·60.
365·24·60·60 =   3.1536·10*7
Type 22/7, 355/113.
    22/7 =       3.14285714
 355/113 =       3.14159292
Type 2*10, 2*.5, 10*(-3).
    2*10 =    1024
    2*.5 =       1.41421356
 10*(-3) =        .001
Type [(1+2)·(3+4)]*2.
[(1+2)·(3+4)]*2 =  441
Type |3-10|.
  |3-10| =       7
